ae442.mp4?t=1774563867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE THE MYSTERY\u2026OR NOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you try to find the truth behind your friend\u2019s murder? Investigate your classmate\u2019s esoteric rituals? Manipulate the upcoming student council elections to your benefit? Or will you strike out on a path entirely your own?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/9fb2d1b681361dda3dcf9ac85ff83367.poster.avif?t=1774563867\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/9fb2d1b681361dda3dcf9ac85ff83367.webm?t=1774563867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/9fb2d1b681361dda3dcf9ac85ff83367.mp4?t=1774563867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMBRACE THE <i>MONSTERHEARTS</i> SPIRIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover iconic features from the acclaimed <i>Monsterhearts</i> tabletop game, part of the Powered by the Apocalypse system. From Strings to Moves to the Darkest Self, it\u2019s all reimagined for a digital experience that stays true to the tabletop game\u2019s spirit while taking them in intriguing new directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/f6201e334b35e3009be785ba03ac356e.poster.avif?t=1774563867\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/f6201e334b35e3009be785ba03ac356e.webm?t=1774563867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/f6201e334b35e3009be785ba03ac356e.mp4?t=1774563867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ludic Lemur makes games that are radically playful. A queer women-led indie studio, we\u2019re on a search for new play and new players. We believe that well-designed games help people grow, joyously improving lives and society. That\u2019s why we make games that expand play to a new level of inclusivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ludic Lemur\u2019s first game was an experimental interactive audio narrative called <i>Calm the Storm</i>, which was nominated in the Achievements in Accessibility category at the Indie Game Awards in 2025. Our narrative paint-by-numbers game, Sun Catcher, will be released in the summer of 2026.</p>","developers":["Ludic Lemur Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/daf2edb78733d11d63c577e4111146cc7fce8366/header.jpg?t=1774563867","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Monsterhearts: Welcome to Drowned Lake is based on the Monsterhearts tabletop roleplaying game, which is owned by Avery Alder of Buried Without Ceremony. Ludic Lemur Entertainment has a non-exclusive license to the setting and game systems.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3827470/979337665/e00a35de608e7b3491c0d74e08079d567680da02/1774463691/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774464308","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3827470/979337665/e00a35de608e7b3491c0d74e08079d567680da02/1774463691/dash_h264.mpd?t=1774464308","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3827470/979337665/e00a35de608e7b3491c0d74e08079d567680da02/1774463691/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774464308","id":257309011,"name":"Game Traile